1st Sub. S.B. 130
River Restoration Amendments
House Amendments Amendment 2 February 03, 2026 05:34 PM
Representative Karen M. Peterson proposes the following amendments:
1. Line 119 through 125:
119 (iii) The division may issue a matching grant to a county or municipality for an
120 improvement project that increases recreational access on the Jordan River, if the
121 county or municipality:
122 (A) provides at least an equal amount of matching funds; and
123 (B) certifies that the county or municipality will spend the grant funds on an
124 improvement project that increases recreational access or improves public
125 safety along the Jordan River.
